{"term": {"label": "德", "occurrences": 3, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "三", "id": "三"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.3877429013343527, "source": "君子", "target": "三"}, {"weight": 1.589235205116581, "source": "君子", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 1.4069136483226263, "source": "君子", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 0.15415067982725836, "source": "君子", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.001448540214462, "source": "君子", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.7137664677626809, "source": "君子", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.1837700970084166, "source": "君子", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 2.1000608288825715, "source": "心", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 0.8472978603872037, "source": "心", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.6945957207744073, "source": "心", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 0.8472978603872037, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.4069136483226263, "source": "心", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.001448540214462, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.2823823856765264, "source": "失", "target": "士"}, {"weight": 2.2823823856765264, "source": "失", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.252762968495368, "source": "知", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 0.5596157879354227, "source": "知", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.252762968495368, "source": "知", "target": "敬"}, {"weight": 0.8472978603872037, "source": "知", "targe